</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><a href="mailto:lukas.gonon@math.ethz.ch">lukas.gonon@math.ethz.ch</a>
</span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">, </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Josef Teichmann
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_address">Josef Teichmann, Eidgenössische Technische Hochschule Zürich, Switzerland
</span>
