<section id="S2.SS0.SSSx3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Hedging</h4>

<div id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">All trading is self-financed, so we may also need to inject additional cash <math id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">p</mi><mn id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑝</ci><cn type="integer" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.1.m1.1c">p_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> into our portfolio. A negative
cash injection implies we may extract cash.
In a market without transaction costs the agent’s wealth at time <math id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1a"><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml">T</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1.1">𝑇</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.2.m2.1c">T</annotation></semantics></math>
is thus given by
<math id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-Z+p_{0}+(\delta\cdot S)_{T}" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1a"><mrow id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mrow id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml"><mo id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3a" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">−</mo><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2.cmml">Z</mi></mrow><mo id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml">+</mo><msub id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4.2.cmml">p</mi><mn id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.4.3.cmml">0</mn></msub><mo id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2a" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml">+</mo><msub id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml"><mrow id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><mrow id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">δ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">⋅</mo><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml">S</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.3.cmml">T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1"><plus id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.