The agent’s terminal portfolio value at <math id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1a"><mi id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1.1" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1.1.cmml">T</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1b"><ci id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1.1">𝑇</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS0.SSSx3.p2.8.m3.1c">T</annotation></semantics></math> is therefore</p>
