<li id="S2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Complex cross-asset cost, such as cost of volatility when trading options across the surface:
assume <math id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{1}" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1a"><msup id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mn id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">1</mn></msup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><cn type="integer" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">1</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1c">S^{1}</annotation></semantics></math> is spot and that the rest of the hedging instruments are
options on the same asset. Denote by <math id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{k}^{i}" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1a"><msubsup id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml">Δ</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml">k</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">i</mi></msubsup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1">superscript</csymbol><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2">Δ</ci><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3">𝑘</ci></apply><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3">𝑖</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.2.m2.1c">\Delta_{k}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math> Delta
and by <math id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}^{i}_{k}" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1a"><msubsup id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml">𝒱</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">k</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml">i</mi></msubsup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1">subscript</csymbol><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2">𝒱</ci><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3">𝑖</ci></apply><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1.1.3">𝑘</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.I1.i3.p1.3.m3.1c">\mathcal{V}^{i}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> Vega of each instrument, for example under a simple Black &amp; Scholes model.</p>
</div>
<div id="S2.I1.i3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2" class="ltx_p">We may then define a simple cross-surface proportional cost model in Delta and Vega for <math id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{k}&gt;0" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><msub id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.2.cmml">c</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.3.cmml">k</mi></msub><mo id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">&gt;</mo><mn id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1"><gt id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.1"></gt><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.2">𝑐</ci><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.3">𝑘</ci></apply><cn type="integer" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.1.m1.1c">c_{k}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{k}&gt;0" display="inline"><semantics id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><msub id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.2" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml">v</mi><mi id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml">k</mi></msub><mo id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">&gt;</mo><mn id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1"><gt id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.1"></gt><apply id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.2">𝑣</ci><ci id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.3">𝑘</ci></apply><cn type="integer" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.I1.i3.p2.2.m2.1c">v_{k}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<table id="S2.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
