</div>
<div id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4" class="ltx_p">In case such an opportunity exists, we obviously have <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho(X)&lt;0" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.2.cmml">ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml">X</mi><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml">&lt;</mo><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2"><lt id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.1"></lt><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.2.2">𝜌</ci><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.1">𝑋</ci></apply><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1.2.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.1.m1.1c">\rho(X)&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Depending on the cost function and our constraints <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1a"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml">ℋ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1.1">ℋ</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.2.m2.1c">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math>, we may be able
to invest an unlimited amount into this strategy. In this case, we get <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(X)=-\infty" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.1.cmml">X</mi><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.1.cmml">=</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.cmml"><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3a" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.cmml">−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.2.cmml">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2"><eq id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.1"></eq><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.2.2">𝜋</ci><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.1">𝑋</ci></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3"><minus id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3"></minus><infinity id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1.2.3.2"></infinity></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.3.m3.1c">\pi(X)=-\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
If this applies to <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=0" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml">X</mi><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1"><eq id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.1"></eq><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.2">𝑋</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.m4.1c">X=0</annotation></semantics></math>, we call such a market <em id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p2.4.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">irrelevant</em>. This is justified by the following observation:</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.Thmtheorem5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_corollary">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Corollary 3.5</span></span><span id="S3.Thmtheorem5.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Assume that <math id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(0)&gt;-\infty" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.cmml"><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml">(</mo><mn id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.1.cmml">0</mn><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml">&gt;</mo><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.cmml"><mo id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3a" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.cmml">−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.2.cmml">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2"><gt id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.1"></gt><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2"><times id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.2.2">𝜋</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.1">0</cn></apply><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3"><minus id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3"></minus><infinity id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1.2.3.2"></infinity></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1.m1.1c">\pi(0)&gt;-\infty</annotation></semantics></math>. Then <math id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(X)&gt;-\infty" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.cmml"><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.3.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.1.cmml">X</mi><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.1.cmml">&gt;</mo><mrow id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.cmml"><mo id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3a" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.cmml">−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.2" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.2.cmml">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2"><gt id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.1"></gt><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2"><times id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.2.2">𝜋</ci><ci id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.1">𝑋</ci></apply><apply id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3"><minus id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3"></minus><infinity id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1.2.3.2"></infinity></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.2.m2.1c">\pi(X)&gt;-\infty</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1a"><mi id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1.1" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1.1.cmml">X</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1b"><ci id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1.1">𝑋</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.Thmtheorem5.p1.3.3.m3.1c">X</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Omega" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1a"><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml">Ω</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1">Ω</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.1.m1.1c">\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> is finite we have <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sup X&lt;\infty" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml"><mo rspace="0.167em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml">sup</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml">X</mi></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">∞</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1"><lt id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"></lt><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1">supremum</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2">𝑋</ci></apply><infinity id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1.1.3"></infinity></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.2.m2.1c">\sup X&lt;\infty</annotation></semantics></math> and therefore, using monotonicity, <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(X)\geq\pi(\sup X)\geq\pi(0)-\sup X&gt;-\infty" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml">X</mi><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.4" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.4.cmml">≥</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.3.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.2.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">sup</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.5" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.5.cmml">≥</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.cmml">(</mo><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.2.2.cmml">0</mn><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.1.cmml">−</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.cmml"><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.1.cmml">sup</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.2.cmml">X</mi></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.7" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.7.cmml">&gt;</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.cmml"><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8a" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.cmml">−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.2.cmml">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"><and id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3a.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"></and><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3b.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"><geq id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.4.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.4"></geq><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.2">𝜋</ci><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.1.1">𝑋</ci></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.2"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.3">𝜋</ci><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.1">supremum</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.1.1.1.2">𝑋</ci></apply></apply></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3c.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"><geq id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.5.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.5"></geq><share href="#S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.1.cmml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3d.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"></share><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6"><minus id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.1"></minus><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.2.2">𝜋</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.2.2">0</cn></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.1">supremum</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.3.2">𝑋</ci></apply></apply></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3e.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"><gt id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.7.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.7"></gt><share href="#S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.6.cmml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3f.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3"></share><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8"><minus id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8"></minus><infinity id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3.3.8.2"></infinity></apply></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.1.p1.3.m3.3c">\pi(X)\geq\pi(\sup X)\geq\pi(0)-\sup X&gt;-\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4" class="ltx_p">We note, however, that irrelevance is not necessarily a consequence of outright arbitrage;
such <em id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">statistical arbitrage</em> may also occur in markets without arbitrage. Consider
to this end the convex risk measure <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho(X):=-\mathbb{E}[X]" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.2.cmml">ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml">X</mi><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.1.cmml">:=</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.cmml"><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3a" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.cmml">−</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.2.cmml">𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.1.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.1.1.cmml">[</mo><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.2.cmml">X</mi><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.1.1.cmml">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.1">assign</csymbol><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.2.2">𝜌</ci><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.1.1">𝑋</ci></apply><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3"><minus id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3"></minus><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.2">𝔼</ci><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.2"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.3.3.2.3.2.1">delimited-[]</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2.2">𝑋</ci></apply></apply></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.1.m1.2c">\rho(X):=-\mathbb{E}[X]</annotation></semantics></math>, and assume that the market without interest rates
is driven by a standard Black &amp; Scholes model with positive drift <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1a"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1.1.cmml">μ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1.1">𝜇</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.2.m2.1c">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> between two time points <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{0}" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1a"><msub id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml">t</mi><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.2">𝑡</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.3.m3.1c">t_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{1}" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1a"><msub id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml">t</mi><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml">1</mn></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.2">𝑡</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1.1.3">1</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p3.4.m4.1c">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e.</p>
