this market remains relevant with <math id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(0)=0" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.cmml"><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.3.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.cmml">(</mo><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.1.cmml">0</mn><mo stretchy="false" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.1" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.1.cmml">=</mo><mn id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.3" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1b"><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2"><eq id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.1"></eq><apply id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2"><times id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.1"></times><ci id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.2.2">𝜋</ci><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.1">0</cn></apply><cn type="integer" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1.2.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS0.SSSx1.p4.4.m4.1c">\pi(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.1. </span>Exponential Utility Indifference Pricing</h3>

<div id="S3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">The following lemma shows that the present framework includes
exponential utility indifference pricing as studied for example in
<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx14" title="" class="ltx_ref">HN89</a>]</cite>, <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx25" title="" class="ltx_ref">MHADZ93</a>]</cite>,<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx30" title="" class="ltx_ref">WW97</a>]</cite> and
<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx21" title="" class="ltx_ref">KMK15</a>]</cite>. Recall that for the exponential utility function
