<div id="S3.SS1.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S3.SS1.1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Using the special form of <math id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline"><semantics id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1a"><mi id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml">U</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1.1">𝑈</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS1.1.p1.1.m1.1c">U</annotation></semantics></math>, one may write the indifference price
as</p>
<table id="S3.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

