<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 3.7</span></span><span id="S3.Thmtheorem7.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span>
</h6>
