<p id="S3.Thmtheorem7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(<a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.2. Optimized certainty equivalents ‣ 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>) defines a convex risk measure.</span></p>
