<div id="S3.Thmtheorem8" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_example">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 3.8</span></span><span id="S3.Thmtheorem8.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S3.Thmtheorem8.p1" class="ltx_para">
