into (<a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.2. Optimized certainty equivalents ‣ 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>), one obtains the <span id="S3.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">entropic risk measure</span>
defined in (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In Lemma 3.6. ‣ 3.1. Exponential Utility Indifference Pricing ‣ 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.4</span></a>) above.</p>
