<div id="S4.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmtheorem3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark 4.3</span></span><span id="S4.Thmtheorem3.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S4.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmtheorem3.p1.15" class="ltx_p">We have two classes of examples in mind: the first one is to take
