<p id="S4.SS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p">We now replace the set <math id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{u}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1a"><msup id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.2.cmml">ℋ</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.3.cmml">u</mi></msup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.2">ℋ</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1.1.3">𝑢</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p3.3.m1.1c">\mathcal{H}^{u}</annotation></semantics></math> in (<a href="#S4.Ex2" title="In Lemma 4.4. ‣ 4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1’</span></a>) by
