</div>
<div id="S4.Thmtheorem7" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmtheorem7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark 4.7</span></span><span id="S4.Thmtheorem7.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We would similarly transform
(<a href="#S3.E3" title="In Remark 3.4. ‣ 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>) into a modified unconstrained problem,
optimized over <math id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{M}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">ℋ</mi><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">M</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">ℋ</ci><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">𝑀</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.m1.1c">\mathcal{H}_{M}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmtheorem8" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmtheorem8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark 4.8</span></span><span id="S4.Thmtheorem8.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4" class="ltx_p">For practical implementations, handling trading constraints with <a href="#S4.Ex4" title="4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a> is not particularly
efficient since the gradient of <math id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Theta_{M}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">Θ</mi><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">M</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">Θ</ci><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">𝑀</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.m1.1c">\Theta_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> of our objective outside <math id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1a"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml">ℋ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1.1">ℋ</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.2.m2.1c">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math> vanishes.
In the case where <math id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\circ\delta=\delta" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1a"><mrow id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mrow id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml">H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1.cmml">∘</mo><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml">δ</mi></mrow><mo id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">δ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1"><eq id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.1"></eq><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2"><compose id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1"></compose><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2">𝐻</ci><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3">𝛿</ci></apply><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1.1.3">𝛿</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.3.m3.1c">H\circ\delta=\delta</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\in\mathcal{H}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1a"><mrow id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml">δ</mi><mo id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml">∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml">ℋ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1b"><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1"><in id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.1"></in><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.2">𝛿</ci><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1.1.3">ℋ</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.4.m4.1c">\delta\in\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math>, this can be addressed by variants of</p>
<table id="S4.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

