<p id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5" class="ltx_p">for Lagrange multipliers <math id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma\gg 0" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.2.cmml">γ</mi><mo id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.1.cmml">≫</mo><mn id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.1">much-greater-than</csymbol><ci id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.2">𝛾</ci><cn type="integer" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.Thmtheorem8.p1.5.m1.1c">\gamma\gg 0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p4.4" class="ltx_p">The next proposition shows that thanks to
the universal approximation theorem, strategies in <math id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1a"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.cmml">ℋ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1">ℋ</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p4.1.m1.1c">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math> are
approximated arbitrarily well by strategies in <math id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{M}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1a"><msub id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">ℋ</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">M</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.2">ℋ</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.3">𝑀</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p4.2.m2.1c">\mathcal{H}_{M}</annotation></semantics></math>. Consequently,
the neural network price <math id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi^{M}(-Z)-\pi^{M}(0)" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2a"><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.cmml"><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.cmml"><msup id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3.2.cmml">π</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.3.3.cmml">M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.2.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1a" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.cmml">−</mo><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">Z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.2.cmml">−</mo><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.cmml"><msup id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2.2.cmml">π</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2.3" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.2.3.cmml">M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.3.2.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.cmml">(</mo><mn id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1.cmml">0</mn><mo stretchy="false" id="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.3.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.p4.3.m3.2.2.3.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.