<div id="S4.SS2.7" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS2.2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">We first note that the argument <math id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{k-1}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">δ</mi><mrow id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml">k</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml">−</mo><mn id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml">1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝛿</ci><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3"><minus id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1"></minus><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2">𝑘</ci><cn type="integer" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3">1</cn></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.1.m1.1c">\delta_{k-1}</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#S4.Ex4" title="4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>
is redundant, since iteratively <math id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{k-1}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1a"><msub id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">δ</mi><mrow id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.cmml">k</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1.cmml">−</mo><mn id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml">1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2">𝛿</ci><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3"><minus id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1"></minus><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2">𝑘</ci><cn type="integer" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3">1</cn></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.2.m2.1c">\delta_{k-1}</annotation></semantics></math> is itself a function of <math id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{0},\ldots,I_{k-1}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3a"><mrow id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml"><msub id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.2.cmml">I</mi><mn id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></msub><mo id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml">…</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.4" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml">,</mo><msub id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.cmml">I</mi><mrow id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.2.cmml">k</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.1" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.1.cmml">−</mo><mn id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.3" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.3.cmml">1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3b"><list id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2"><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.2">𝐼</ci><cn type="integer" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.3">0</cn></apply><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.1.1">…</ci><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2">𝐼</ci><apply id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3"><minus id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.1"></minus><ci id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.2">𝑘</ci><cn type="integer" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3.3">1</cn></apply></apply></list></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.2.p1.3.m3.3c">I_{0},\ldots,I_{k-1}</annotation></semantics></math>.
We may therefore write for the purpose of this proof</p>
