<div id="S4.SS2.4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">By definition, there exists
<math id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\in\mathcal{H}^{u}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">δ</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">∈</mo><msup id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml">ℋ</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.3" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml">u</mi></msup></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1"><in id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1"></in><ci id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2">𝛿</ci><apply id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.2">ℋ</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.3.3">𝑢</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.4.p3.1.m1.1c">\delta\in\mathcal{H}^{u}</annotation></semantics></math> such that</p>
