<p id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9" class="ltx_p">Combining this with (<a href="#S4.E3" title="In Proof. ‣ 4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>), there
exists <math id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in\mathbb{N}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.2.cmml">n</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.1.cmml">∈</mo><mi id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.3.cmml">ℕ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1"><in id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.1"></in><ci id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.2">𝑛</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1.1.3">ℕ</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.7.p6.9.m1.1c">n\in\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math> (large enough) such that</p>
