\mathbb{E}[\exp(F^{\theta}\circ\bar{I})]=1\end{subarray}}\left(\mathbb{E}[-X\exp(F^{\theta}\circ\bar{I})]-\bar{\alpha}(F^{\theta}\circ\bar{I})\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
