<div id="S4.SS5.6" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS5.2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We proceed in two steps. In a first step we show that for any
<math id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">X</mi><mo id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><in id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1"></in><ci id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑋</ci><ci id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">𝒳</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS5.2.p1.1.m1.1c">X\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math> one may write</p>
<table id="S4.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(4.11)</span></td>
