<div id="S4.SS5.4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Combining (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In Proof. ‣ 4.5. Extension to general risk measures ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.12</span></a>), (<a href="#S4.E13" title="In Proof. ‣ 4.5. Extension to general risk measures ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.13</span></a>) and the
definition of <math id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\alpha}" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1a"><mover accent="true" id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">α</mi><mo id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">¯</mo></mover><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1"><ci id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.1">¯</ci><ci id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1.1.2">𝛼</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS5.4.p3.1.m1.1c">\bar{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math> one obtains</p>
