<p id="S4.SS5.5.p4.6" class="ltx_p">Combining (<a href="#S4.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ 4.5. Extension to general risk measures ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.15</span></a>) with (<a href="#S4.E11" title="In Proof. ‣ 4.5. Extension to general risk measures ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.11</span></a>) and
