<p id="S4.SS5.6.p5.15" class="ltx_p">Precisely as in the proof of Proposition <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem9" title="Proposition 4.9. ‣ 4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.9</span></a>, one may
