<div id="S4.SS5.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Combining (<a href="#S4.Ex4" title="4.2. Optimal hedging using deep neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E10" title="In Theorem 4.13. ‣ 4.5. Extension to general risk measures ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.10</span></a>), one thus
approximates (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>) for <math id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=-Z" display="inline"><semantics id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">X</mi><mo id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mrow id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml"><mo id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3a" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">−</mo><mi id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml">Z</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1"><eq id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.1"></eq><ci id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑋</ci><apply id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3"><minus id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3"></minus><ci id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1.1.3.2">𝑍</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS5.p6.1.m1.1c">X=-Z</annotation></semantics></math> by solving</p>
