the notation of Definition <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Definition 4.1. ‣ 4.1. Universal approximation by neural networks ‣ 4. Approximating hedging strategies by deep neural networks ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, <math id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F^{\theta_{k}}" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1a"><msup id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.2" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.2.cmml">F</mi><msub id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.2" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.2.cmml">θ</mi><mi id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.3" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.3.cmml">k</mi></msub></msup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1b"><apply id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.2">𝐹</ci><apply id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.2">𝜃</ci><ci id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1.1.3.3">𝑘</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.SS1.p1.12.m12.1c">F^{\theta_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math> is a neural
