<section id="S5.SS2.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">A brief reminder on the Heston model</h4>

<div id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p1.16" class="ltx_p">Recall that a Heston model is specified by the stochastic differential
equations</p>
<table id="S5.E2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S5.E2X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_left">(5.2)</span></td>
