</tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14" class="ltx_p">Thus, if continuous-time trading was possible,
(<a href="#S5.E5" title="In A brief reminder on the Heston model ‣ 5.2. Benchmark: No transaction costs ‣ 5. Numerical experiments and results ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.5</span></a>) shows that the option payoff can be
replicated perfectly by trading in <math id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(S^{1},S^{2})" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2a"><mrow id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.3.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.3.cmml">(</mo><msup id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mn id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml">1</mn></msup><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.4" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><msup id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.2.cmml">S</mi><mn id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.3.cmml">2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.5" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.3.cmml">)</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2b"><interval closure="open" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2"><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><cn type="integer" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.1.1.1.1.3">1</cn></apply><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2">superscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.2">𝑆</ci><cn type="integer" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2.2.2.2.3">2</cn></apply></interval></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.SS2.SSSx1.p3.14.m1.2c">(S^{1},S^{2})</annotation></semantics></math> according to
the strategy (<a href="#S5.E6" title="In A brief reminder on the Heston model ‣ 5.2. Benchmark: No transaction costs ‣ 5. Numerical experiments and results ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.6</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="S5.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S5.Thmtheorem2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark 5.2</span></span><span id="S5.Thmtheorem2.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span>
</h6>
<div id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The strategy (<a href="#S5.E6" title="In A brief reminder on the Heston model ‣ 5.2. Benchmark: No transaction costs ‣ 5. Numerical experiments and results ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.6</span></a>) depends on <math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{t}" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">V</mi><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑉</ci><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">𝑡</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.m1.1c">V_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Although
not observable directly, an estimate can be obtained by estimating
<math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{0}^{t}V_{s}\,\mathrm{d}s" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><msubsup id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml"><mo id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.2.cmml">∫</mo><mn id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.3.cmml">0</mn><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.3.cmml">t</mi></msubsup><mrow id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml"><msub id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.2.cmml">V</mi><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.3.cmml">s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml">​</mo><mrow id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml"><mo rspace="0em" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.1.cmml">d</mo><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.2.cmml">s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1"><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1">superscript</csymbol><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><int id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.2"></int><cn type="integer" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2.3">0</cn></apply><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.3">𝑡</ci></apply><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2"><times id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1"></times><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.2">𝑉</ci><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.3">𝑠</ci></apply><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.1">differential-d</csymbol><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.2">𝑠</ci></apply></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.m2.1c">\int_{0}^{t}V_{s}\,\mathrm{d}s</annotation></semantics></math> and solving (<a href="#S5.E4" title="In A brief reminder on the Heston model ‣ 5.2. Benchmark: No transaction costs ‣ 5. Numerical experiments and results ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.4</span></a>) for <math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{t}" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1a"><msub id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml">V</mi><mi id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2">𝑉</ci><ci id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3">𝑡</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.3.m3.1c">V_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS2.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Setting: Discretized Heston model</h4>

<div id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.12" class="ltx_p">In addition to the setting explained in detail in
Section <a href="#S5.SS1" title="5.1. Setting and Implementation ‣ 5. Numerical experiments and results ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a>, here we set <math id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=2" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">d</mi><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mn id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">2</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><eq id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1"></eq><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑑</ci><cn type="integer" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">2</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1.m1.1c">d=2</annotation></semantics></math>, consider no
transaction costs (i.e. <math id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{T}\equiv 0" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><msub id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml">C</mi><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml">T</mi></msub><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">≡</mo><mn id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1"><equivalent id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"></equivalent><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.2">𝐶</ci><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.3">𝑇</ci></apply><cn type="integer" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1.1.3">0</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.2.m2.1c">C_{T}\equiv 0</annotation></semantics></math>) and generate sample trajectories
of the price process of the hedging instruments from a discretely
sampled Heston model. Thus, <math id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S=(S_{0},\ldots,S_{n})" display="inline"><semantics id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3a"><mrow id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.4" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.4.cmml">S</mi><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml">=</mo><mrow id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml"><mo stretchy="false" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml">(</mo><msub id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mn id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.3.cmml">0</mn></msub><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.4" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml">…</mi><mo id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.5" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml">,</mo><msub id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.2" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.2.cmml">S</mi><mi id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.3" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.2.3.cmml">n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2.6" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3b"><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3"><eq id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.3"></eq><ci id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.4.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.4">𝑆</ci><vector id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.3.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.3.3.2.2"><apply id="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2.2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S5.SS2.SSSx2.p1.3.m3.2