Proposition <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem10" title="Proposition 3.10. ‣ 3.2. Optimized certainty equivalents ‣ 3. Pricing and hedging using convex risk measures ‣ Deep Hedging" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.10</span></a>(ii)), for (CVar) we have evaluated
